===Etymology===
From {{der|en|oc|brocada}} and {{der|en|es|-}} and {{der|en|pt|brocado}}, influenced by {{der|en|fr|brocart}}, from {{der|en|it|broccato}}, from {{m|it|brocco}}, ultimately from {{der|en|cel-gau|-}}.

